3cff1384aad9.600x338.jpg?t=1757108406"}],"short_description":"Drive into a world where a Bluff and a Bomb are separated by only a small wire, tied up by a psychopath in chairs with bombs strapped to their chests, play games, vote for losers and must cut a wire, risking instant death. Test your skill. Outsmart the imposter to be the survivor.","steam_appid":3498650,"support_info":{"email":"team@wakastudio.co","url":"www.wakastudio.co"},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}